## Errors & Mistakes
The first draft listed mechanisms to avoid (hooks, decorators, monkey patches, global configuration, implicit ordering, inheritance). That list was removed after reading the prompting guides, because current models follow instructions literally and the list could stop uses that a framework or repository requires.

